.\" Manpage for zenthcloudd.
.TH man 1 ${DATE} "${VERSION}" "zenthcloudd man page"
.SH NAME
zenthcloudd \- creates a connection to the zenthcloud edge network
.SH DESCRIPTION
zenthcloudd creates a persistent connection between a local service and the Zenthcloud network. Once the daemon is running and the Tunnel has been configured, the local service can be locked down to only allow connections from Zenthcloud.
